{"id":"1507ded5fe871bd8","group":"58","path":"58/batch17/58-df-closure-operator.md","title":"Closure Operator $\\mathrm{Closure}$","display":"df-closure-operator — Closure Operator $\\mathrm{Closure}$","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-closure-operator","aliases":["58-df-closure-operator","58-df-Closure"],"display":"df-closure-operator — Closure Operator $\\mathrm{Closure}$","depends_on":["[[../batch16/58-df-function.md]]","[[../batch16/58-df-omega.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-closure-operator"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-closure-operator</span><span>58-df-Closure</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-closure-operator — Closure Operator <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Closure}\">\\(\\mathrm{Closure}\\)</span>"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"36d7463d215be751\" href=\"?note=36d7463d215be751\" title=\"../batch16/58-df-function.md\">../batch16/58-df-function.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"5045d216c83e75cb\" href=\"?note=5045d216c83e75cb\" title=\"../batch16/58-df-omega.md\">../batch16/58-df-omega.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X\\coloneqq\\omega^\\omega\">\\(X\\coloneqq\\omega^\\omega\\)</span>（Baire 空间中的一元自然数函数集）</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal F\\subseteq X\">\\(\\mathcal F\\subseteq X\\)</span>（生成函数族）</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal O\\subseteq\\bigcup_{n\\in\\omega}X^{X^n}\">\\(\\mathcal O\\subseteq\\bigcup_{n\\in\\omega}X^{X^n}\\)</span>（有穷元运算族）</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{arity}:\\mathcal O\\to\\omega\">\\(\\operatorname{arity}:\\mathcal O\\to\\omega\\)</span>，且每个 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"op\\in\\mathcal O\">\\(op\\in\\mathcal O\\)</span> 满足 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"op:X^{\\operatorname{arity}(op)}\\to X\">\\(op:X^{\\operatorname{arity}(op)}\\to X\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal G\\subseteq X\">\\(\\mathcal G\\subseteq X\\)</span>（候选闭集）</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Closure}:V^3\\rightharpoonup V\">\\(\\mathrm{Closure}:V^3\\rightharpoonup V\\)</span>，且 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Closure}(\\mathcal F,\\mathcal O,\\operatorname{arity})\\subseteq X\">\\(\\mathrm{Closure}(\\mathcal F,\\mathcal O,\\operatorname{arity})\\subseteq X\\)</span>（此处定义的生成闭包）</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}closure-operator} \\vdash \\mathrm{Closure}(\\mathcal F,\\mathcal O,\\operatorname{arity})\\coloneqq\\bigcap\\{\\mathcal G\\subseteq X:\\mathcal F\\subseteq\\mathcal G\\land\\forall op\\in\\mathcal O\\;\\forall\\vec f\\in\\mathcal G^{\\operatorname{arity}(op)}\\;(op(\\vec f)\\in\\mathcal G)\\}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}closure-operator} \\vdash \\mathrm{Closure}(\\mathcal F,\\mathcal O,\\operatorname{arity})\\coloneqq\\bigcap\\{\\mathcal G\\subseteq X:\\mathcal F\\subseteq\\mathcal G\\land\\forall op\\in\\mathcal O\\;\\forall\\vec f\\in\\mathcal G^{\\operatorname{arity}(op)}\\;(op(\\vec f)\\in\\mathcal G)\\}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X\">\\(X\\)</span> 自身是候选闭集，因此定义交集非空，并确实给出包含 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal F\">\\(\\mathcal F\\)</span> 且对 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal O\">\\(\\mathcal O\\)</span> 封闭的最小子集。</li>\n<li>元数映射是闭包算子的显式第三参数，使零元运算与不同元数的运算都具有确定类型，且结果不依赖隐藏的外部指定。</li>\n<li>原始递归函数可作为该构造的一个实例，但生成族必须包含零函数、后继和投影，运算族必须正确编码复合与原始递归。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Related-Concepts\">[Related Concepts]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"1cf46a0ea13ab5dd\" href=\"?note=1cf46a0ea13ab5dd\" title=\"../batch01/58-df-primitive-recursive.md\">../batch01/58-df-primitive-recursive.md</a> — 原始递归函数</li>\n<li><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"a2ef5ac555fe2963\" href=\"?note=a2ef5ac555fe2963\" title=\"../batch01/58-df-composition-operator.md\">../batch01/58-df-composition-operator.md</a> — 复合算子</li>\n<li><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"886d3e2a93a3e218\" href=\"?note=886d3e2a93a3e218\" title=\"../batch02/58-df-primrec-operator.md\">../batch02/58-df-primrec-operator.md</a> — 原始递归算子</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2},{"id":"Related-Concepts","text":"[Related Concepts]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch16/58-df-function.md","status":"resolved","id":"36d7463d215be751","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch16/58-df-function.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch16/58-df-omega.md","status":"resolved","id":"5045d216c83e75cb","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch16/58-df-omega.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch01/58-df-primitive-recursive.md","status":"resolved","id":"1cf46a0ea13ab5dd","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Related Concepts]","excerpt":"[[../batch01/58-df-primitive-recursive.md]] — 原始递归函数","embed":false},{"target":"../batch01/58-df-composition-operator.md","status":"resolved","id":"a2ef5ac555fe2963","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Related Concepts]","excerpt":"[[../batch01/58-df-composition-operator.md]] — 复合算子","embed":false},{"target":"../batch02/58-df-primrec-operator.md","status":"resolved","id":"886d3e2a93a3e218","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Related Concepts]","excerpt":"[[../batch02/58-df-primrec-operator.md]] — 原始递归算子","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathrm{Closure}","display":false},{"tex":"X\\coloneqq\\omega^\\omega","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal F\\subseteq X","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal O\\subseteq\\bigcup_{n\\in\\omega}X^{X^n}","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{arity}:\\mathcal O\\to\\omega","display":false},{"tex":"op\\in\\mathcal O","display":false},{"tex":"op:X^{\\operatorname{arity}(op)}\\to X","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal G\\subseteq X","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Closure}:V^3\\rightharpoonup V","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Closure}(\\mathcal F,\\mathcal O,\\operatorname{arity})\\subseteq X","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}closure-operator} \\vdash \\mathrm{Closure}(\\mathcal F,\\mathcal O,\\operatorname{arity})\\coloneqq\\bigcap\\{\\mathcal G\\subseteq X:\\mathcal F\\subseteq\\mathcal G\\land\\forall op\\in\\mathcal O\\;\\forall\\vec f\\in\\mathcal G^{\\operatorname{arity}(op)}\\;(op(\\vec f)\\in\\mathcal G)\\}","display":true},{"tex":"X","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal F","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal O","display":false}],"bytes":1904,"backlinks":[{"id":"a2ef5ac555fe2963","anchor":"ref-6","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch17/58-df-closure-operator.md]] — 闭包算子"},{"id":"da0bcf2e3f060472","anchor":"ref-10","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"a11585cba9c21cfd","anchor":"ref-246","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[58-df-closure-operator]]"},{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-293","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch17/58-df-closure-operator.md|58-df-closure-operator]]（batch17）"}],"outgoing":["36d7463d215be751","5045d216c83e75cb","1cf46a0ea13ab5dd","a2ef5ac555fe2963","886d3e2a93a3e218"]}